                        "glosses": [
                            "to scold"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1484d304-5f85-4f58-a293-e323f79701fd",
                                "sense_id": "565a7551-67f0-3e94-b386-7e2ba731d4f3",
                                "text": "На сле́дующее у́тро, когда́ я сошёл к ча́ю, ма́тушка побрани́ла меня́ — ме́ньше, одна́ко, чем я ожида́л — и заста́вила меня́ рассказа́ть, как я провёл накану́не ве́чер.",
                                "translation": "The next morning, when I came down to tea, my mother scolded me—less severely, however, than I had expected—and made me tell her how I had spent the previous evening.",
                                "english": "The next morning, when I came down to tea, my mother scolded me—less severely, however, than I had expected—and made me tell her how I had spent the previous evening."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
